      "claim": "Gemcitabine, a close deoxycytidine analog, is a substrate for intestinal equilibrative and concentrative nucleoside transporters, and cladribine intestinal uptake is transporter-mediated; this provides a positive absorptive mechanism that can compensate for low passive permeability.",
