    },
    {
      "claim": "EFdA has low Caco-2 Papp (~4–6×10^-7 cm/s) yet high oral bioavailability, showing that low Caco-2 permeability does not preclude F >= 20% for nucleoside analogs and undermining the L4 low-permeability inference.",
      "card_ids": ["C60", "C62", "C21"]
    },
